# Origin of the API, without a trailing slash — e.g. https://job-tracker-api.onrender.com
#
# Leave it unset for local development (the Vite proxy serves /api) and for
# `docker compose up` (nginx serves /api). Set it only when the SPA is hosted
# somewhere the API isn't, such as Vercel in front of Render.
#
# Vite inlines this at build time, so changing it requires a rebuild — editing it in a
# hosting dashboard without redeploying changes nothing.
VITE_API_ORIGIN=
